<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HUMAN GOLD RUSH LESSON</p><h1>Community Pulse</h1><p class="intro">Community Pulse makes consented activity visible without turning people into scores.</p><blockquote>What can a community learn from presence while honoring every person’s dignity?</blockquote></header><aside class="notice"><strong>Important distinction</strong><p>Illustrative interface only. Connect these cards to approved, consented data sources before publication.</p></aside><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Whole-quarter view</h2><p>The current quarter aggregates the complete twelve-week window: LAUGH events, invitations, responses, pledges, fulfillment, gratitude, disputes, re-entry, and maturity.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>XP is one signal</h2><p>XP (Experience Presence) tracks confirmed showing-up moments; NWP (network-weighted presence) rolls those moments up across a group. Neither measures a person’s worth, character, virtue, or financial value.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Numbers need listening</h2><p>Every quantitative observation should produce a listening question. A dashboard cannot explain a person’s motive.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Research boundary</h2><p>Public views use aggregation. Identifiers and linkage keys remain outside public dashboards.</p></div></article><article><span>05</span><div><h2>Reputation score, pending</h2><p>A reputation score stays pending until two things happen: showing up, and receiving gratitude. It is a record of follow-through, not a credit score, and it never converts to money.</p></div></article></section><section><div class="section-heading"><p>CURRENT 12-WEEK WINDOW</p><h2>Whole-quarter community pulse</h2></div><div class="data-grid"><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>LAUGH events</span></div><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>Voluntary responses</span></div><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>Fulfillment records</span></div><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>Gratitude recognized</span></div><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>Walk-aways</span></div><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>Open disputes</span></div><div class="data-card"><strong>—</strong><span>XP (Experience Presence)</span></div></div></section>